id: 280
r#  50290  915  42


--- Sentence//end
id: 280
r#  50587  922  52
p: .
t. 
|  We have a
|  structural model for how people comport themselves
|  to situations so as to observe and act rationally;
|  therewith we seamlessly transition
|  from nonverbal orientation toward surrounding
