p: .
t. 
|   And, in particular, the
|  menagerie of theoretical posits in
|  phenomenology and in linguistics are interrelated,
|  as <!(15)!> and <!(16)!> hopefully illustrate. <!!"!!>The meaning of a sentence is a function of its words and
.  how they are composed<!!"!!> (cf. [/JamesPustejovsky:2/])


