p: .
t. 
|   Here I simply want to observe that
|  such grounding is holistic in the sense that it encompasses
|  a central verb (profiling some event,
|  or process) as well as
.  the set of noun-concepts or -foci that participate therein


--- Sentence/switch
id: 479
r#  85848  1609  60


--- Sentence//end
id: 479
r#  86052  1613  28
p: .
t. 
|  The central spine that pulls together multiple thematic
|  relata likewise consolidates multiple sites for speaker
|  grounding/epistemics, allowing listeners to piece together
.  speakers' belief-provenance

--- Sentence/end 
id: 479
r#  86053  1613  29

