r#  88698  1665  18
p: .
t. 
|  In cognition, meanwhile, the line between
|  predicative belief and practical know-how is more
.  radically blurred


--- Sentence/switch
id: 491
r#  88699  1665  19


--- Sentence//end
id: 491
r#  88827  1667  37
p: .
t. 
|   For one thing, facts are not isolated data-points;
|  they are inextricably contextualized
.  by conceptual and pragmatic networks


--- Sentence/switch
id: 492
r#  88828  1667  38


--- Sentence//end
